learningCards.content:
flowchart TD
  START[需要传输数据] --> RELIABLE{必须可靠且按序?}
  RELIABLE -->|是| TOLERATE{是否能容忍 TCP 队头阻塞和握手延迟?}
  TOLERATE -->|能| TCP[TCP: HTTP/SSH/DB]
  TOLERATE -->|不能| QUIC[QUIC/HTTP3 基于 UDP 自实现可靠]
  RELIABLE -->|否| REALTIME{是否强实时, 丢包优于卡顿?}
  REALTIME -->|是| RTP[UDP + RTP: 音视频/网游/直播]
  REALTIME -->|否| SHORT{是否短报文一问一答?}
  SHORT -->|是| DNS[UDP: DNS/NTP/DHCP]
  SHORT -->|否| BROADCAST{需要广播/组播?}
  BROADCAST -->|是| MULTI[UDP 组播]
  BROADCAST -->|否| TCP

